This product is an independent, cross-vendor compute runtime built on the
Khronos Vulkan API. It is not affiliated with, endorsed by, or sponsored by
NVIDIA Corporation. "CUDA" is a trademark of NVIDIA Corporation and is used
in this project only in a descriptive sense when discussing migration and
compatibility with CUDA source code.

HCSUDA does not install, replace, or modify GPU kernel-mode drivers. Hardware
access is provided exclusively through the Vulkan loader and the vendor driver
already installed on the system.

